JobCopilot AI

Your AI-powered job search companion.

JobCopilot AI helps you organize applications, tailor job materials, and stay prepared through every stage of your job search. Track opportunities on a visual board, manage multiple profiles, save interview notes, and use AI to create better application materials faster.

What you can do with JobCopilot AI:
- Track jobs across Saved, Applied, Interview, Offer, and Rejected stages
- Paste a job description and generate a tailored resume
- Create cover letters, cold emails, and recruiter replies
- Prepare for interviews with role-specific AI-generated questions and prompts
- Save interview notes, follow-up reminders, and important details for each job
- View stats for pipeline progress, activity, and source effectiveness
- Chat with AI using your profile as context

Why JobCopilot AI:
- Clean visual job tracker
- Built for active job seekers
- Multiple profiles for different roles
- Smart follow-up reminders
- Private, focused, and easy to use

Privacy:
JobCopilot AI is designed to keep your data on your device. No signup required. AI features require your own API key.

Available on iPhone and iPad.

